      "source": "By default this is set to 10000 (10 seconds) even though the Servlet API\nspecifies a default async request timeout of 30 seconds. Keep in mind the\ntimeout could further be impacted by global configuration through the MVC\nJava config or the XML namespace, as well as be overridden per request on\n<a href=\"../../web/context/request/async/DeferredResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context.request.async\"><code>DeferredResult</code></a>\nor on\n<a href=\"../../web/servlet/mvc/method/annotation/SseEmitter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.mvc.method.annotation\"><code>SseEmitter</code></a>.",
